# HELP spacelift_worker_pool_workers_by_status The number of workers in a worker pool by status: idle, busy, draining (drained and busy) or drained (drained and idle). draining plus drained normally equals spacelift_worker_pool_workers_drained (each from a separate request). busy plus draining equals spacelift_worker_pool_workers_busy when the API's busyWorkers count matches the workers' busy flags: that series comes from the pool's busyWorkers field and not from the worker list
# TYPE spacelift_worker_pool_workers_by_status gauge
spacelift_worker_pool_workers_by_status{status="busy",worker_pool_id="01HQZXE1B2C3D4E5F6G7H8J9K0",worker_pool_name="first-pool"} 0
spacelift_worker_pool_workers_by_status{status="drained",worker_pool_id="01HQZXE1B2C3D4E5F6G7H8J9K0",worker_pool_name="first-pool"} 0
spacelift_worker_pool_workers_by_status{status="draining",worker_pool_id="01HQZXE1B2C3D4E5F6G7H8J9K0",worker_pool_name="first-pool"} 0
spacelift_worker_pool_workers_by_status{status="idle",worker_pool_id="01HQZXE1B2C3D4E5F6G7H8J9K0",worker_pool_name="first-pool"} 0
